{'symbol': 'PANW', 'date': '2021-10-01 08:15:00', 'title': 'PALO ALTO NETWORKS POSITIONED AS A LEADER IN 2021 GARTNER MAGIC QUADRANT FOR WAN EDGE INFRASTRUCTURE', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF., OCT. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PALO ALTO NETWORKS (NYSE: PANW ), THE GLOBAL CYBERSECURITY LEADER, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT PALO ALTO NETWORKS PRISMA® SD-WAN HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED AS A LEADER IN THE 2021 GARTNER® MAGIC QUADRANT™ FOR WAN EDGE INFRASTRUCTURE.'}